&lt;p&gt;· Hands-on experience with Active Directory, DNS/DHCP, Hyper-V, and IIS&lt;br&gt;· Knowledge of NIST, FISMA, FedRAMP, DISA STIGs, and vulnerability management&lt;br&gt;· Experience with VMware, Hyper-V, and cloud platforms (AWS, Azure)&lt;br&gt;· Managing Hyper-V clusters in enterprise environments.&lt;br&gt;· Windows Server Failover Clustering (WSFC) and Hyper-V networking/storage architecture.&lt;br&gt;· PowerShell scripting for automation and operational efficiency.&lt;br&gt;· SAN/NAS storage integration and performance tuning&lt;br&gt;· Understanding of TCP/IP, subnetting, and network security basics&lt;br&gt;· Proficiency in PowerShell, Bash, or other scripting languages for automation&lt;br&gt;· Ability to analyze issues, document solutions, and communicate technical details to non-technical stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
