&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;SMX has an immediate opportunity for a &lt;strong&gt;Cloud Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; who is excited to apply their talents to our customer&#39;s challenging project and one who will thrive in a collaborative environment. The ideal candidate is a recognized professional with hands-on expertise and an excellent understanding of engineering processes supporting large, National Defense, Agile software development programs. With a team of system and software engineers in a fast-paced environment you will be an integral part of Intel Community programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;This role is on site Monday - Friday in either Chantilly, VA, Herndon, VA or Aurora, CO. This position requires the Security+ certification and an active TS/SCI CI Poly clearance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties and Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, development, and integration of ashore and afloat network and cloud-agnostic system architectures to meet operational objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams, including engineers, program managers, and other stakeholders, to ensure seamless system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct system assessments, troubleshoot issues, and recommend enhancements for optimal performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare technical documentation, diagrams, and reports for stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design of architectures for Windows Server–based enterprise IT systems and management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with systems and network engineering teams to assess current-state environments and identify migration dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop detailed workload migration plans, including timelines, risk assessments, and mitigation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with technical and program managers to ensure alignment of architecture plans with broader project goals and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance and oversight during implementation phases to ensure architectural compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale delivery of modern systems engineering best practices, including digital engineering, automation, and orchestration across both systems and network solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills/Experience:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clearance: TS/SCI CI Polygraph&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On site support Monday - Friday in Chantilly, VA, Herndon, VA or Aurora, CO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security+ certification&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 4+ years of experience in building, deployment, release automation, or orchestration, along with expertise in supporting cloud applications and infrastructures across platforms like AWS, Microsoft Azure, or Google Cloud.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with infrastructure-as-code environments, automated configurations, large-scale software deployments, and continuous integration/delivery processes, as well as proficiency in containerization tools such as Docker, OpenShift, or Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must possess a TS/SCI clearance with a polygraph, a high school diploma or GED, and must have certifications such as Security+ CE, SSCP, CCNA-Security, or GSEC. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional preferred qualifications include scripting abilities in languages like Bash, PowerShell, or Python, familiarity with protocols including JSON and XML, an understanding of frameworks like OWASP or DevSecOps, and a cloud certification (e.g., AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate, Google Cloud Architect, or MCSE – Cloud Platform).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and the ability to enhance automation processes will set exceptional candidates apart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
