&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate functional expertise for cloud computing technologies, configurations, and environments (hybrid, native, multi-cloud, on-prem, etc).Provide support to various customers and technical cloud implementation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports cross-functional teams through execution of enterprise cloud initiatives across IaaS, PaaS, SaaS, and Kubernetes-based platforms within DoD environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct various levels of research, product building, presentations and delivery, providing expertise and recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify “best in breed” solutions supporting technical cloud implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical discussions both internally and with customer or vendor teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on cloud-native services and optimizing the customer landscape through adoption of these services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and/or support cloud migration strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and/or lead discussions in customer, partner engagements, and leadership meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent certification plus 4 years&#39; experience for junior-level, 7 years&#39; experience for mid-level, and 10 years&#39; experience for senior-level)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active Security Clearance Required: &lt;strong&gt;Secret&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
