&lt;li&gt;Prior experience supporting United States Air Force cloud programs (AWS Govcloud)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ServiceNow (or similar) implementations and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PM or Scrum Master certification(s)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DoD 8570 compliant certification: CompTia Sec+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
