&lt;li&gt;Scripting language experience is preferred by not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CISSP, CEH, CASP or additional security certifications are preferred but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional years of experience can be substituted in lieu of degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must possess the ability to obtain a Public Trust and DoD security clearance&lt;/li&gt;
