&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;SMX is seeking a highly skilled&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Computer Systems Administrator&lt;/strong&gt; to provide 24x7 operational support for classified enterprise systems and mission networks. Responsibilities include proactive monitoring, incident response, break/fix support, configuration management, patch management, and system availability for critical Army mission systems. We are seeking professionals to support the Ground Intelligence Support Activity (GISA) who are responsible for the overall architecture of various technologies, transmission, and termination of digital communication across the globe for the Department of Army on behalf of the U.S. Army G2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
