&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of backup and recovery of complex systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for maintaining an operational network in a facility to that maintains 24/7/365 operations.. Responsible for implementing infrastructure and cyber security controls, that include enhanced detection of vulnerability capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
