&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TS/SCI CI Poly clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with architecting and designing IP networks, including developing and documenting network topologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with troubleshooting and restoring network and system outages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with implementing Cisco ISE and a TACACS provider&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with designing and implementing DoD enclaves, including compute storage, networking, routing, switching, firewalls, and end-user devices&lt;/li&gt;
