&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with technical system security reviews using system scan tools, including ACAS and SCAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise server, storage, software, and application services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in pushing configurations with automation through Ansible or Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
