&lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-field lifesuite__rte--display&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Contractor Logistics Support (CLS) Specialist serves as the primary onsite technical authority and operator for the FLRAA MV-75 simulation environment. You will ensure maximum operational readiness of simulation enclaves, tactical host computers, and facility power and HVAC systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simulator Operations:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform daily system initialization, readiness testing, and visual display calibration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate the Instructor Operator Station (IOS) to support military aircrews during training events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintenance &amp;amp; Troubleshooting:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Isolate hardware and software faults down to the Line Replaceable Unit (LRU) level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with engineering reach-back teams for complex repairs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May be required to Act as the onsite executor for system modifications by receiving, verifying, and uploading software updates and patches sent from the OEM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure successful installation, conduct operational checks, and confirm functionality within the simulation environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VP to FTD Upgrade Support:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Program Office in overseeing the prototype-to-FTD transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review OEM-presented upgrades plans, engineering changes, and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the PO and training team during testing, troubleshooting, and validation events to verify the OEM’s upgrades achieve concurrency with actual aircraft configurations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generator Support:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute scheduled Preventative Maintenance Checks and Services (PMCS) and monthly load-bank testing on the facility&#39;s dedicated military 10K diesel generator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logistics:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct physical inventories of Government Furnished Equipment (GFE) and submit required maintenance and discrepancy reports.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VIP Hosting &amp;amp; Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary facility host for distinguished visitors (DVs), external stakeholders, and Program Office personnel. Conduct site tours covering simulator operational basics, facility capabilities, and a general overview of the FLRAA MV-75 Virtual Prototype&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct the Maintenance onsite using the Program Structure Documents developed by Bell, CAE and TRU Simulation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support all maintenance components documented in Maintenance and Operations Manuals and provided documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan to have proper personnel at the facility trained on device architecture and device maintenance theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team members will be integrated into the FLRAA Program Office team and will be expected to support various activities such as reviewing documentation, conducting procedures, assisting with parts integration into the devices, supporting the tear-down and packing procedures, as well as other various tasks related to the devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearance Required: Secret&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree and 8 years of related experience, OR 15 years of experience with no degree
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous Aviation Military training highly valued in lieu of a degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of direct experience in flight simulation maintenance, Hardware-in-the-Loop (HWIL) systems, or tactical systems support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience configuring flight simulators, operating an IOS, and performing maintenance/load testing on military diesel tactical generators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Desired Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with PAE maneuver air&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Aviation acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
