&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, - Information Technology, Data Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 years of professional experience in a data engineering or backend software engineering role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active Top Secret security clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in SQL and data query creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AWS services, specifically AWS Glue, Glue Catalog, and Step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Functions for data integration and workflow automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data modeling, data migration, and ETL functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal, with the ability to interface with customers&lt;/li&gt;
