&lt;p&gt;SMX is looking for a Data Manager to support a Missile Defense Agency program based at Redstone Arsenal in Huntsville, AL.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data Manager will execute and oversee the full lifecycle of test and mission data across MDA systems – including ingestion, parsing, cataloging, distribution, and archival.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data Manager ensures data products are delivered accurately, securely, and on time to support analysis and decision-making, serving as a bridge between test event operations and data consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely, standardized delivery of data products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute parsing, cataloging, ingestion, and archival processes in line with relevant procedures and timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, validate, and report data delivery status from receipt through dissemination and archival, ensuring metadata completeness and policy compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify data format and metadata compliance from providers and address any non-standard inputs with Data Owners as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate archival and destruction activities in compliance with retention schedules while maintaining proper documentation and traceability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct QA checks to validate data integrity, reconcile orphan files, and verify cataloging accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accountability of physical and digital media, ensuring check-in/out procedures are followed and inventory status is accurate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate and maintain trackers, reports, and dashboards on data readiness, ingestion metrics, and distribution milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide surge and after-hours support for critical test events as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other data management tasks as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearance Required: Secret
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US citizenship is required for work on DoW contract&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree and 2+ years, &lt;strong&gt;OR&lt;/strong&gt; a high school diploma and 6+ years of experience in data management or test data operations is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must reside within &lt;strong&gt;70 miles of Redstone Arsenal&lt;/strong&gt; or be willing to relocate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with mission test environments, metadata standards, and secure data handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of end-to-end data lifecycle management (collection, validation, ingestion, dissemination, archival).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data governance principles, metadata standards, and retention policy enforcement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data transfer protocols and classified data workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and coordination skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with strong organizational, documentation, and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate in a fast-paced, mission-critical environment and meet tight deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree in Information Systems, Engineering, Data Management, or a related field is desired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualization utilizing dashboards and PowerBI is desired&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MDA or DoD programs strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of SQL or similar query/reporting tools preferred&lt;/li&gt;
