&lt;p&gt;SMX is seeking a Data Scientist to join our team in support of a Modernized Data Science Platform for a Federal customer. The focus of this role is to bridge the gap between business needs and technical solutions, focusing on requirements analysis, business process improvement, and data-driven decision-making to support the program&#39;s IT transformation and modernization activities. If you are interested in joining a high-performing team with advancement opportunities, then look no further!&lt;/p&gt;
