&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;FedRAMP, DoD, or DISA experience with ATO processes.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Security+ certification (or equivalent DoD 8570/8140 baseline certification).&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience managing or interpreting vulnerability scanning results and integrating them with POA&amp;amp;M workflows.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Key Competencies&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong analytical and documentation skills.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Excellent communication and stakeholder management.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to balance technical depth with business/mission requirements.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Risk-based decision-making and a continuous improvement mindset.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Self-directed and able to collaborate effectively across a remote, cross-functional team.&lt;/p&gt;
