&lt;p&gt;SMX is seeking a&lt;strong&gt; JICO &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;to plan, coordinate, and manage joint tactical data link operations and multi-TDL network integration. The role supports a reliable SOF - common tactical picture across joint and coalition command-and-control systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a full-time onsite position at MacDill AFB in SOCOM HQ.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Plan and manage multi-TDL architecture, information exchange requirements, and interface control procedures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
