&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience with JICO, interface control, or joint tactical data link operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of Link 16, JREAP, joint data networks, and command-and-control systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ability to translate operational requirements into practical integration plans and work across technical and mission teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
