&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Clearance Required: Top Secret&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 3 years of professional experience in systems administration, IT infrastructure support, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active CompTIA Security+ certification or equivalent DoD 8570 IAT Level II certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience administering, configuring, and troubleshooting Linux operating systems, including RHEL, Ubuntu, or CentOS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of macOS administration, configuration, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise endpoint management, software deployment, and system maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of DoD cybersecurity requirements, system hardening, and security compliance practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with DISA STIG implementation, vulnerability management, and remediation processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of networking fundamentals, operating system security, and troubleshooting methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical troubleshooting, problem-solving, documentation, and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, prioritize competing requirements, and collaborate effectively with technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work onsite at NAS Patuxent River, MD, and support classified and unclassified computing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
