&lt;p&gt;SMX is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Program Management Support Lead (PMO Lead)&lt;/strong&gt; to support our Army Client.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the ARES PMO support function and coordinate the work of PMO personnel and embedded Value Stream Analysts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Government Program Manager to establish and continuously improve a lightweight ARES management system that provides reliable visibility into:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demand, intake, priorities, and backlog health;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in progress, delivery flow, and delivery forecasts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity, operational workload, and development-versus-operations tradeoffs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risks, dependencies, blockers, decisions, and escalation needs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrated roadmaps, customer commitments, and strategic outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain a practical operating cadence for integrated program reviews, backlog and flow reviews, roadmap synchronization, risk/dependency review, and decision tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain common Jira and Confluence structures, workflows, data definitions, dashboards, and documentation practices that support program management needs while minimizing administrative burden on delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Jira, ITSM, and related management data are sufficiently complete and reliable to support trend analysis, capacity decisions, contractual reporting, and leadership decision support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive-ready management products, including integrated roadmap views, portfolio health assessments, decision briefs, risk summaries, delivery updates, and contractual deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Government-led intake and triage process by coordinating demand capture, initial analysis, estimation inputs, routing, decision documentation, and status communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Product Managers, Value Stream Analysts, technical leads, platform personnel, customer-enablement personnel, and external partners to identify cross-team dependencies, resource conflicts, delivery risks, and decisions requiring Government attention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support proportionate management of sustained mission services, including visibility into operational workload, critical service conditions, critical-period readiness, release impacts, customer commitments, and continuity risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage PMO documentation, including program schedules, integrated roadmaps, risk and dependency registers, decision records, meeting outcomes, management dashboards, and required program-management deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to simplify processes, improve data quality, reduce reporting friction, and strengthen management decision quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current Active Secret Clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of progressively responsible experience supporting program, portfolio, project, product-delivery, or PMO functions in a complex technical environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in a PMO leadership, delivery-management, portfolio-management, or equivalent senior coordination role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience establishing or maturing PMO, delivery-management, portfolio-management, or integrated planning functions within an active operational environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing lightweight governance, integrated planning, demand management, risk/dependency management, capacity visibility, and executive decision support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on proficiency with program and project management tools such as Jira, Confluence, and reporting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise data, analytics, software delivery, IT platforms, digital transformation, or technology-enabled business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading through influence across technical, functional, customer, and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong change-management instincts and experience moving a workforce from informal coordination to more visible, disciplined execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to analyze work-management data and translate it into clear, decision-ready insights on demand, flow, capacity, delivery risk, and operational workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and coordinating geographically or functionally distributed support personnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including preparation of executive briefings, decision papers, program reviews, and management reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work independently, build trust across diverse stakeholders, and bring structure to ambiguous, evolving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Desired Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting Army, DoW, or other Federal digital, data, analytics, financial-management, logistics, or enterprise IT programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kanban, Lean portfolio management, Agile delivery management, IT service management, or product operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting data-product, data-pipeline, dashboard, platform, or enterprise-service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing integrated roadmaps, managing external dependencies, and supporting senior-leader decision forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a hybrid environment that requires on-site collaboration with Government and contractor personnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise IT service management, product operations, platform operations, or service-delivery management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP, PgMP, PMI-ACP, ITIL, Scrum, Kanban, or comparable certification.&lt;/li&gt;
