&lt;li&gt;Assist in managing client-related efforts, including tracking progress, deadlines, and deliverables, while ensuring clear communication with all stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend meetings, take detailed and actionable notes, and ensure follow-up on key points and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, edit, and format presentations and documents for the team and client&lt;/li&gt;
