&lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-field lifesuite__rte--display&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SMX is seeking a motivated and experienced SAP Analytics Cloud (SAC) Developer to join our innovative Solutions team. The successful candidate will be responsible for designing, building, and implementing robust budget planning,&amp;nbsp; and reporting solutions for our federal government clients. This role involves collaborating with diverse groups of functional and technical subject matter experts to deliver high-quality, impactful SAC solutions that meet complex client needs. You will work in a supportive, team-oriented environment where knowledge sharing and mentorship are key to our collective success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business and functional requirements from senior consultants and business analysts into detailed technical specification documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, test, and deploy best-in-class SAC solutions, including data models, advanced stories, and analytical applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement complex calculations, data actions, and business logic using JavaScript and other SAC-native features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure customer demos and translate requirements into working functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in testing and defect resolution during implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the solution architect and data integration team on design and data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
