&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree from an accredited college or university, preferably in Finance, Accounting, Information Systems, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of hands-on development experience with SAP Analytics Cloud (SAC) Planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overall experience of 5+ years in designing and building Budgeting Planning &amp;amp; Reporting solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise in SAC Data Modeling, creating Stories, and building Analytical Applications.&lt;/li&gt;
