&lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-item ui-form-item-horizontal&quot; data-direction=&quot;horizontal&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-field lifesuite__rte--display&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-field lifesuite__rte--display&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SMX is seeking a detail oriented and diligent security information technology system administrator to provide comprehensive support to Army Special Programs Directorate (ASPD). The ideal candidate would be comfortable with executing the processes for various aspects of Information Technology Management in a secure environment. The ideal candidate should also be comfortable working with a multi-disciplinary team to create, author, and brief repeatable frameworks and analyses focused on providing insights into potential vulnerabilities, stakeholder requirements, and necessary evolutions to a client’s portfolio with the goal of identifying, understanding, and mitigating different types of risks.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; They should understand the fundamental security concepts, risk management, and network infrastructure. The ideal candidate will have an entrepreneurial mindset, willing to own the processes and projects for which they have responsibility, understand the context in which they operate, and advocate for improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The candidate will assist the team by providing comprehensive support in all aspects of physical security and program management to include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing visitor and resident access control and badging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing administrative/business process support for processing Program Access requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering applicable security education and training for employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing technical and planning support for Special Access Program (SAP) security meetings and other events, including coordination of the meetings, visit access requests, drafting meeting agendas, slide decks and talking points. It will also include setup, attendance tracking, operation of VTC equipment, taking meeting notes, recording tracking action items, finalizing and distributing minutes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with multi-disciplinary teams to help create, implement, refine, and disseminate mixed-method frameworks and approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update or create required documentation (e.g., policies, security classification guides) to achieve outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently facilitate workshops, meetings, and training across the lifecycle of a project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a liaison to subject matter experts across highly diverse mission fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide advice and recommendations to client leadership and other cross-organizational management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform security and office management administrative duties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Facility Security Officer (FSO) with security audits, inspections, and the maintenance of required documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain property book and coordinate with other building tenets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills/Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely detail oriented. They will need to run security processes end-to-end, noting key details, extracting next tasks, and identifying gaps in datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work independently to pull together security reports and briefings along with other deliverables, drawing from disparate meetings, emails, documents, etc. The deliverables they produce will be expected to go directly for senior review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer service oriented and an excellent communicator in multiple formats (writing, verbal, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated stakeholder management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to manage work orders and subordinate staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Task leadership experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience working with SAPCO – Army SAPCO ideal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CompTIA Security+ or higher certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TS/SCI clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires full-time on-site support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Desired Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management Professional (PMP) certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of secure business operational activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or higher&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The SMX salary determination process takes into account a number of factors, including but not limited to, geographic location, Federal Government contract labor categories, relevant prior work experience, specific skills, education and certifications. At SMX, one of our Core Values is to Invest in Our People so we offer a competitive mix of compensation, learning &amp;amp; development opportunities, and benefits. Some key components of our robust benefits include health insurance, paid leave, and retirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The proposed salary for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$93,700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$156,200 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SMX®, we are a team of technical and domain experts dedicated to enabling your mission. From priority national security initiatives for the DoD to highly assured and compliant solutions for healthcare, we understand that digital transformation is key to your future success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We share your vision for the future and strive to accelerate your impact on the world. We bring both cutting edge technology and an expansive view of what’s possible to every engagement. Our delivery model and unique approaches harness our deep technical and domain knowledge, providing forward-looking insights and practical solutions to power secure mission acceleration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SMX is an Equal Opportunity employer including disabilities and veterans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;message-body-1758638857922&quot; class=&quot;fui-ChatMyMessage__body rcngbzt ___eyw0iv0 f10pi13n ftqa4ok f2hkw1w f8hki3x f1d2448m f1bjia2o ffh67wi f1j6vpng f1pniga2 f987i1v f1ffjurs f15bsgw9 f14e48fq f18yb2kv fd6o370 ffwy5si f3znvyf f57olzd f4stah7 f480a47 fs1por5 fk6fouc figsok6 fkhj508 f19n0e5 f9ijwd5 fzqqayd f10ostut f1o0qvyv f9ggezi f1xp5gbu f150uoa4 ffyari3 fo7qwa0 f16xkysk fxowb0n f11ghf3q f13aoclr flypziy f10kwr27 fquw1qa fftr39l f13lathq f15hsm81 f2ss68y ffb60jq f8nuap2 f13nk4fk f7jacry fq08z5q fd9af6s fr74w9q fcl9uv6 f13sm7pj f1u6qqly f16wpxbl faim3u9 f6cs3qo fa2w2z3 fd39nx6 f10gn8j9 frcqmxy f1w9ws4k f1ddxkqj fd10euv fvuz61 f1nbc6gw&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;content-1758638857922&quot; class=&quot;fui-Primitive ___16zla5h f1oy3dpc fqtknz5 fyvcxda&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
