&lt;p&gt;SMX does not sponsor a new applicant for employment authorization or immigration related support for this position (i.e. H1B, F-1 OPT, F-1 STEM OPT, F-1 CPT, J-1, TN, E-2, E-3, L-1 and O-1, or any EADs or other forms of work authorization that require immigration support from an employer).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-item ui-form-item-horizontal&quot; data-direction=&quot;horizontal&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-field lifesuite__rte--display&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-field lifesuite__rte--display&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SMX is seeking an &lt;strong&gt;Agile Delivery Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to serve as the embedded delivery-management and workflow coordination lead for an assigned ARES value stream or delivery area. The role works closely with Government Product Managers, the ARES PMO Lead, technical leads, developers, data engineers, functional experts, and stakeholders to ensure that priorities are translated into clear, actionable work and that workload, delivery flow, risks, dependencies, and commitments are visible and manageable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is not solely a Scrum Master role. The successful candidate will use Agile, Kanban, and other practical delivery-management practices as appropriate, but the primary purpose of the position is to help ARES teams organize work, maintain delivery flow, coordinate across stakeholders, and provide reliable management insight to program leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;ARES is an enterprise data and analytics capability that delivers trusted data products, pipelines, dashboards, and decision support in support of Army financial management, audit readiness, logistics and asset reporting, enterprise resource planning modernization, and other mission needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the delivery-management and workflow coordination lead for an assigned ARES value stream, product area, platform function, or delivery team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Government Product Managers, PMO personnel, technical leads, functional experts, and stakeholders to translate priorities and mission needs into structured, actionable work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the full work lifecycle from intake through analysis, triage, backlog refinement, prioritization support, development, delivery, release, and follow-on sustainment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a clear, current, and appropriately structured team backlog in Jira under the direction of the Government Product Manager and in coordination with the ARES PMO Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure work items include sufficient context for the delivery team, including the requested outcome, scope, priority, users or stakeholders affected, acceptance criteria, dependencies, assumptions, and relevant operational or service impacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate practical team routines, including backlog refinement, Kanban or flow reviews, delivery coordination sessions, risk and dependency discussions, and action follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Agile and Kanban practices pragmatically to improve visibility, predictability, and team coordination; avoid imposing ceremonies or processes that do not improve delivery or decision quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and communicate work in progress, blocked work, backlog readiness, work-item aging, delivery forecasts, capacity constraints, operational workload, risks, and dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help distinguish and track new capability work, enhancements, defects, incidents, data-quality issues, access requests, routine support, and other operational work so that the program can understand how capacity is being used.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with technical leads and delivery personnel to capture estimates, sequencing needs, technical dependencies, release considerations, and external coordination requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate material risks, blockers, cross-team dependencies, and capacity conflicts to the PMO Lead and appropriate Government or contractor leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support release readiness by coordinating work-item completion, validation needs, stakeholder awareness, release documentation, known limitations, and follow-on work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear and useful Confluence documentation, including team working agreements, requirements artifacts, decision and action records, release information, and knowledge-transfer material.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop concise status updates, management summaries, briefings, and Jira-based reports that accurately reflect team conditions and support leadership decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture stakeholder feedback, customer-support themes, recurring issues, and lessons learned; ensure relevant information informs backlog refinement and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the VSA community of practice led by the PMO Lead to implement common ARES standards for work visibility, reporting, documentation, risk escalation, and delivery coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current Active Secret Clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience supporting project delivery, program delivery, business analysis, product operations, technical requirements analysis, or comparable functions in a technical environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of hands-on experience using Jira and Confluence to manage work, maintain documentation, track delivery progress, and generate reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting technical delivery teams, such as software development, data engineering, analytics, DevOps, platform operations, or enterprise IT services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience supporting an end-to-end work lifecycle: intake, analysis, triage, refinement, prioritization support, development, delivery, release, and sustainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to turn ambiguous requests or stakeholder needs into clear, actionable work items, requirements, user stories, acceptance criteria, or functional descriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience facilitating backlog refinement, Kanban or workflow reviews, delivery coordination, task follow-up, and team-level risk or dependency discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze Jira or related work-management data to identify workload trends, bottlenecks, delivery risks, blocked work, capacity constraints, and operational demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational, written communication, verbal communication, and stakeholder-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, exercise sound judgment, maintain clear documentation, and collaborate productively across technical, functional, Government, and contractor teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Desired Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise data, analytics, dashboard, data-pipeline, software, platform, or IT service-management programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting a complex Government, DoW, Army, or other Federal program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kanban, Lean delivery management, Agile delivery, product operations, IT service management, or service-desk workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience preparing executive-ready status updates, management briefings, risk summaries, or decision-support materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified ScrumMaster, PMI-ACP, ITIL, Kanban, CBAP, PMP, or similar credential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Functional familiarity with financial management, logistics, audit readiness, or related Army mission areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Functional knowledge of Army Finance or Logistics is helpful but not required. ARES has established functional and technical experts within its value streams. The VSA’s primary value is organizing work, strengthening communication, improving delivery flow, and ensuring leadership has an accurate view of team capacity, commitments, risks, and progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
