&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pre-wrap ng-binding ng-scope&quot;&gt;SMX is seeking a Journeyman level SOC Analyst to support our NAWCAD customer onsite at the Patuxent River Naval Air Station.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
