&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pre-wrap ng-binding ng-scope&quot;&gt;We are currently seeking an Integrated Product Support Logistician supporting the Future Long Range Assault Aircraft (FLRAA) Project Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
