&lt;li&gt;8 years of experience in providing integrated product support efforts for Army and/or DoD acquisition programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with procedures, processes, and management of an acquisition program as it pertains to IPS Familiarity with Acquisition and IPS standards, regulations, policies, procedures, processes, techniques, and organizations&lt;/li&gt;
