&lt;div class=&quot;ui-form-field lifesuite__rte--display&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SMX is seeking a strong SAP Transportation Management (TM) experience on S/4HANA to support future-state design validation sessions for the Navy’s Plan-to-Stock team. This person must be able to shape the to-be design and the future state connection between Navy SAP TM and JTMS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and actively participate in future-state design validation sessions with Navy P2S stakeholders, functional leads, system integrator personnel, logistics SMEs, technical teams, and related JTMS stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review current-state transportation and stock-replenishment processes, identify operational pain points and gaps, and translate validated business needs into practical SAP S/4HANA TM future-state capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the end-to-end to-be design for transportation processes supporting Plan-to-Stock activities, from transportation demand through planning, execution, tracking/visibility, freight settlement, and downstream financial or inventory impacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how SAP S/4HANA TM should support transportation requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in supply chain management, logistics, transportation management, information systems, business administration, operations management, industrial engineering, computer science, or a closely related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on SAP TM design experience in SAP S/4 HANA, focused on future-state process design and solution validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead and facilitate design sessions that map Navy transportation needs into SAP TM capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing how SAP TM will work with external transportation systems (JTMS interface focus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong facilitation skills with business and technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum Secret DoD clearance required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Prior DoD or federal supply chain / logistics experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SAP EWM exposure is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
